{{Protection}}{{MagicWords}}[[File:Card Evolution.png|thumb|300x300px|center]]

Card Evolution is a feature that allows specific [[Cards]] placed in the Evolution slots to become more powerful. Card Evolution and the Evolution slot are both unlocked at [[Arenas#Trophy Road|Arena]] 3, with the Wild slot, that lets you choose if you want to activate an Evolution, or a Hero version of a Card at Arena 10. A card evolves after a certain number of Cycles. Cycles are the amount of times the original card must be deployed into the Arena to obtain the Card Evolution. For Instance, if a card requires 2 Cycles to evolve, every 3rd of that card would be its Card Evolution. This can be tracked as once you deploy the card, a diamond above the card art will be filled in the next time it comes into your hand. Every card with an Evolution takes 6 [[Magic Items|Evolution Shards]] or [[Magic Items|Wild Shards]] to be used in [[Basics of Battle|battle]]. When a Card Evolution is deployed, a special deploy sound will play while a purple light temporarily shines down on them. When you obtain a Card Evolution in a match, a guitar riff will play. All Card Evolutions have a special ability that the original card doesn't have. In addition to the ability, some Card Evolutions have increased stats to compensate for their appearance in battle.

==Obtaining Evolutions==
===Evolution Shards===
Evolution Shards can be obtained from [[Shop]] offers, Community Events, [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Special Challenges]], [[Pass Royale]], 5-Star [[Lucky Chests]], [[Pass Royale]], [[Chests#Evolution Box|Evolution Boxes]], and every other [[Chests|Level Up Chest]] past [[Experience|King Level 50]]. 5-Star Lucky Chests have a 4.3% chance to drop a full Evolution, while events contain 3 Evolution Shards of an Evolution that appeared four months prior, and Pass royale unlocks the current season's Evolution in the paid side of tier 1. If you obtain an Evolution Shard via Shop Offers, Pass Royale or Community Events for an Evolution you already have, they'll convert into a significant amount of extra cards for the regular form of the Evolution. This amount varies based on the card’s rarity, with the conversion rates being 1,000 {{Rarity|Common}} cards, 250 {{Rarity|Rare}} cards, 40 {{Rarity|Epic}} cards, and 2 {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards. If an Evolution Shard is obtained for a card that the player does not own, the card is unlocked for them automatically.

===Wild Shards===
[[File:Wild Shard.png|thumb|80x80px]]
Wild Shards can be obtained from Shop Offers, Special Challenges, Pass Royale, and 4-Star Lucky Chests. The Pass Royale will always contain 2 Wild Shards and 4-Star Lucky Drops have a 3% chance to drop one. Unlike Evolution Shards, Wild Shards are capable of being used on any card with an Evolution, and go beyond the player's limit.

